: "Sinbad: Soratobu Hime to Himitsu no Shima pilot footage included with the DVD release. It features Sana's chase scene in which Sinbad first interacts with her. The footage was not recycled for the film and no dialogue is used.", "startDate": {"year": 2015, "month": 12}, "endDate": {"year": 2015, "month": 12}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 2, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action"], "tags": []}, {"id": 143317, "title": {"romaji": "Changbaekan Eolguldeul", "english": "On The White Planet"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "In an unknown time when everything is colorless, the world pale and desolate, everybody is born with pale white skin. There is absolutely no sign of color in this world at all. However, one boy is born with yellowish skin. Everybody treats him like some sort of monster, and the boy lives in isolation, in the woods with his mother. The year he turns 16, the boy’s depressed mother, unable to bear the seclusion, commits suicide. The boy blames himself for her death and dreams of becoming a normal pale-skinned person.<br>\n<br>\n<i>Won the Grand Prize at the 18th Holland Animation Film Festival</i>", "startDate": {"year": 2015, "month": 9}, "endDate": {"year": 2015, "month": 9}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 73, "countryOfOrigin": "KR", "source": null, "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Drama"], "tags": []}, {"id": 143492, "title": {"romaji": "RETRO FUTURE", "english": null}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "A \"remix version\" of Modern with a soundtrack by Matsuo Oono, which turns the satisfying orderliness of Modern into a cold, disturbing landscape.\n<br><br>\n\"The world of the future I imagined in childhood is different from the world of the future I can visit now.\"", "startDate": {"year": 2015, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 2015, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 7, "countryOfOrigin": 